name=Layered Placement [B42] - MP Compatible
id=LayeredPlacement
description=Makes Move Furniture Place work more like the admin brush for lights, posters, and other wall/ceiling decor. Put lights over furniture and hang stuff on railings and catwalks. Outdoor and railing lights use battery when there is no building power. The easier light on/off controls are disabled in this version and will return once targeting is reliable. Server owners set allowed features in Sandbox Options; players can opt out in Mod Options. Floor furniture unchanged. Multiplayer supported - enable on server and all clients. B42.20+.
